UID:qde_QS6Oqw4h-19ajDZIs
SUMMARY:Houston World of Hot Wheels IV
DTSTAMP:20260716T055638Z
DTSTART:20260725T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:🚗🏁 Houston World of Hot Wheels IV is roaring back with more thr
	ills and speed! 🏁🚗\nAfter an electric\, action-packed weekend of nonstop d
	eals\, racing\, and collector excitement\, Houston World of Hot Wheels IV 
	is revving up for another round! We’re bringing even MORE vendors\, MORE c
	ars\, and MORE action for collectors\, racers\, and families to enjoy all 
	weekend long. ⚡ \n  \n📅 July 25–26\, 2026 | 10AM–5PM\n📍 9700 Bissonnet St 
	1500\, Houston\, TX\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \nEvent Highlights\n🛒
	 Hot Wheels Swap & Shop – Both Days\n50+ vendors. 30\,000+ Hot Wheels\, Ma
	tchbox\, and diecast to dig through. STHs\, TH variations\, premium Car Cu
	lture\, redline-era pieces\, MOC vintage\, loose mainline bins\, M2s\, Gre
	enlights\, Johnny Lightnings. Bring your want list! \n  \n🚗✨ Houston Dieca
	st Custom Contest – 10AM-3PM | Both Days\nCalling all builders and custom 
	kings 👑 Bring your best custom Hot Wheels/Matchbox build — paint\, wheel s
	waps\, stance\, body kits\, full one-of-one creations. This contest is for
	 the detail freaks and the true “trust the process” customizers. 🏆 The win
	ner will be announced at 4PM and will receive a prize sponsored by Domingo
	! ✨ Hosted by @funopolistoys \n  \n🏁 Hot Wheels Racing Contest – Both Days
	\nThe stage track is live all weekend. Hourly races\, prizes for winners\,
	 FREE to enter. Saturday at 12PM\, 2PM\, and 4PM. Sunday Every hour from 1
	1AM – 4PM. ✨ Hosted by Kool Kids \n  \n👶 Mini Zones & Family Fun\nFun spac
	es for younger collectors and first‑time racers — all ages welcome! \n  \n
	🎨✨ Face Painting – 10AM-5PM | Saturday \nBring the kids by for colorful fa
	ce painting and fun custom designs\, available throughout the day for a sm
	all fee! 🌈 $10 for face paint\, painted “tattoos” for $8 ✨ Hosted by @voil
	slinda \n  \n🚨 VENDORS WANTED\nGot STHs\, vintage redlines\, custom builds
	\, or bulk mainline to move? This is your crowd.\n📥 Apply: https://tinyurl
	.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHouston \n  \n🏨 Special Hotel Deals\nEnjoy a specia
	l room rate of $79/night at TownePlace Suites\, just about 15 minutes from
	 the venue!\n👉 Book: https://www.marriott.com/event-reservations/reservati
	on-link.mi?id=1767823967549&key=CORP&app=resvlink \n  \nHunt or race. Trad
	e or just walk the floor. The customs will be parked outside\, the bins wi
	ll be open inside\, and the track will be running all weekend. See you Jul
	y 25–26.\n\nhttps://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-world-of-hot-wheels-iv/
	\n\nFrom CCS Houston
